<title>POLAND: STOMIL OLSZTYN AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 5.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL OLSZTYN AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 5.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.15 vs   8.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.09 vs  10.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.55 vs  10.59</p>
<p> Sales		   63.67 vs  48.10</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    33.29 vs  47.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	50.77 vs  55.86</p>
<p> Operating profit    44.60 vs  56.19</p>
<p> Sales		  438.28 vs 336.43</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
